(text "NOTES\n1. CM4 on the FRONT (facing the screen); everything else small is on the BACK, max 2.5 mm tall\n   (except the CR2032 holder: see build-sheet.md). Nothing on the front under the CM4 (1.5 mm stacking).\n2. High-speed pairs: DSI1 100 ohm differential, USB 90 ohm differential, each pair matched to 0.15 mm.\n3. Linux: dtoverlay=i2c-rtc,pcf85063a,i2c_csi_dsi  enable_uart=1  dtparam=ant2 (external antenna on the CM4 U.FL).\n4. Unused CM4 pins carry no-connect flags; pin-map.md gives the reason for each." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 240 232 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "213e8b8e-3ce3-53ef-b06b-68d977dad298"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
